# GA-001 — Chief Agent Genesis Program

Status: Draft

Authority: Vision 2050 Alignment

Priority: Strategic

---

# Mission

The Genesis Program establishes the initial education of the Chief Agent.

Rather than beginning operation with little or no engineering experience, the Chief Agent shall inherit the complete engineering history of KoreLumina.

The construction of KoreLumina is the Chief Agent's first engineering education.

Every lesson learned while building KoreLumina becomes part of the Chief Agent's institutional understanding.

Genesis is not data migration.

Genesis is organizational learning reconstruction.

---

# Vision Alignment

Vision 2050 establishes that KoreLumina's greatest product is not software.

Its greatest product is enduring engineering capability.

The Genesis Program is the first implementation of that vision.

Rather than waiting until KoreLumina is complete, engineering capability begins compounding on the first day of development.

Every engineering activity contributes to future organizational intelligence.

---

# Core Principle

Nothing learned while building KoreLumina should ever be lost.

Every engineering decision should become reusable engineering intelligence.

Every engineering failure should improve future engineering.

Every engineering success should strengthen organizational capability.

---

# Genesis Scope

Genesis reconstructs the complete engineering evolution of KoreLumina.

The objective is not historical preservation.

The objective is engineering understanding.

---

